sure that the data entered during the payment process are correct, accurate, and valid. If you use a card for another person, you must have authorization or permission to use it.</p>       <p>13.3. When paying for a card, the card must have sufficient credit to cover the purchase.</p>       <p>13.4. In the case of E-payment, the customer will receive a notification once the payment is accepted. If the transaction is not completed or is declined, the customer is requested to contact the issuing bank of their card to determine the reason for the rejection or failure.</p>       <p>13.5. The payment gateway may charge administrative fees upon payment, and these fees vary depending on the method used. Such fees shall be deducted from the Service Provider, and the platform shall bear no responsibility for them. These fees are as follows: (A) MADA fees: 1%, (B) Credit Cards fees: 2.25%, (C) Verification fraud and administration fees: 1 SAR for each successful transaction. These fees may vary depending on the type of card or payment method used.</p>       <p>13.6. Any amounts or fees paid outside the “Kitty Moments” platform shall not be considered.</p>       <p>13.7. Your data is securely protected using the latest encryption and electronic security technologies.</p>       <p>13.8. The payouts to service provider are made via bank transfer to the pre-registered bank account provided by the service provider.</p>       <p>13.9. The service provider is responsible for ensuring their bank account details are accurate and up to date to avoid delays in payouts.</p>       <p>13.10. We reserve the right to add new payment methods in the future or cancel any existing ones, and the data and terms will be updated accordingly.</p>     </section>     <section id=\"shipping-policy\">       <h2>14. Shipping Policy</h2>       <p>14.1. To facilitate shipping and delivery of the order as quickly as possible, the customer must add the delivery address and data accurately, which includes full