ponsibility for any recommendations of any service that may appear to the user because these results and recommendations are the results of estimated or automated statistical data subject to the information, opinions or data collected from users.</p>     </section>     <section id=\"licenses-acceptance-use-policy\">       <h2>18. Licenses Acceptance Use Policy</h2>       <p>18.1. Kitty Moments Company grants you a limited, personal, non-exclusive, non-transferable, non-sublicensable license to download the “Kitty Moments” App, and access the content, information, and related materials that may be made available through the services in accordance with these terms.</p>       <p>18.2. The license granted to you does not include any property rights on or part of the “Kitty Moments” platform, nor does this license directly or indirectly indicate a partnership of any kind between us and you.</p>       <p>18.3. You are prohibited from using the “Kitty Moments” platform and its services in violation of these terms, you may not:</p>       <p>18.3.1. Use the platform to breach any applicable laws or regulations in the Kingdom of Saudi Arabia.</p>       <p>18.3.2. Reproduce, modify, prepare derivative works based upon, distribute, license, lease, sell, resell, transfer, publicly display, transmit, stream, broadcast, or otherwise exploit the platform.</p>       <p>18.3.3. Reverse engineer, decompile or disassemble the platform.</p>       <p>18.3.4. Link to, mirror or frame any portion of the platform.</p>       <p>18.3.5. Impersonate any person or entity, including any employee or representative of the “Kitty Moments”.</p>       <p>18.3.6. Submit unwanted emails, spam, or messages that support any illegal activities.</p>       <p>18.3.7. Tamper with data or attempt to modify or destroy any security or documentary procedures.</p>       <p>18.3.8. Submit or post files that contain material that could be considered harmful, scandalous, pornographic, sexually, indecent, vulgar, violent, offensive, insulting, threatening, harassing, hateful or unacceptable.</p>       <p>18.3.9. Interfere with the operation of the platform, by distributing viruses, adware, spyware, or any other technologies such as cancelbots, malicious code, or similar technologies that may disrupt or interfere with the operation or provision of the platform.</p>       <p>18.3.10. Attempt to gain unauthorized access to or impair any aspect of the services or its related systems or networks.</p>       <p>18.3.11. Remove any copyright, trademark or other proprietary notices from any portion of the platform.</p>       <p>18.3.12. Infringe the copyright, trademark, patent, or other intellectual property rights that belong to us or third parties.</p>     </section>     <section id=\"legal-disclaimer-policy\">       <h2>19. Legal Disclaimer Policy</h2>       <p>19.1. The “Kitty Moments” platform and its services are provided based on “as is” or “as available” without any warranties or representations of any kind whether express or implied.</p>       <p>19.2. We make no representation, warranty, or guarantee regarding the reliability, timeliness, quality, suitability, or availability of the services, or that the services will be uninterrupted or error-free.</p>       <p>19.3. We will not be responsible for any loss or damage caused by any virus, distributed denial-of-service attack, or other technologically harmful material that may infect your computer equipment, computer programs, equipment, software, or other material due to your use of the “Kitty Moments” platform.</p>       <p>19.4. We shall not be held responsible for the incorrect data or contents of the services provided by the service provider whose services are available on the “Kitty Moments” platform.</p>       <p>19.5. The “Kitty Moments” platform will not be responsible for any losses or damages, whether direct or indirect, consequential or incidental, arising from:</p>       <p>19.5.1. The delay or failure in performan