r losses of every kind and nature, arising out of such disputes.</p>       <p>19.8. The “Kitty Moments” platform is not responsible for delays or failures in performance caused by uncontrollable circumstances or force majeure.</p>       <p>19.9. We strive to do our utmost to ensure that the “Kitty Moments” platform is available for use in 24-hour, but the platform might stop from time to time due to acts of repair, maintenance, or development. We might at any time modify, suspend, or interrupt the platform services without sending a notification to you thereof. Also, we might suspend your use of our services in case you violate these terms.</p>       <p>19.10. We do not warrant that technical defects will be fixed, or that the platform, or servers will be free from viruses or other harmful components.</p>       <p>19.11. We have the right to suspend or cancel your account at any time without notice in case you have misused the platform from our point of view or violate these terms, the privacy policy, or the laws in force in the Kingdom of Saudi Arabia.</p>     </section>     <section id=\"intellectual-property-rights-and-trademarks\">       <h2>20. Intellectual Property Rights and Trademarks</h2>       <p>20.1. Kitty Moments Company reserves all intellectual property rights in the “Kitty Moments” platform, the services and all rights related thereto, including but not limited to, commercial appearance, names, trademarks, service marks, slogans, campaigns, designs, logos, icons, artwork, drawings, photographs, video, graphic materials, text, fonts, programs, audio files, digital materials, documents, data, and forms, and it is protected by intellectual property.</p>       <p>20.2. Kitty Moments Company retains all rights to the trademarks of the “Kitty Moments” platform, whether registered or unregistered, and they may not be reproduced or used in any media or advertising without our written permission.</p>       <p>20.3. Kitty Moments Company retains all rights on 