nity Kitty Moments Company and to acquit its liability and its officers, directors, employees, and agents as well as defend it against all the actions, claims, costs, or expenses including legal fees and attorney’s fees arising out of or in connection with:</p>       <p>22.1.1. The claims or demands arising from your misuse of the “Kitty Moments” platform.</p>       <p>22.1.2. Taking any action that would damage the work and reputation of the “Kitty Moments” platform whether directly or indirectly.</p>       <p>22.1.3. Violation of the terms, policies, and operating rules of the “Kitty Moments” platform, or any applicable laws.</p>       <p>22.1.4. Violation of the rights, including intellectual property, confidentiality, or privacy.</p>       <p>22.2. “Kitty Moments” platform, its officials, and employees shall not be legally liable to you or to another party for any direct or indirect loss or any other cost that might arise from, in connection with the performance of these terms or the provisions of our services.</p>       <p>22.3. You shall be bound to compensate for any losses or damages caused to the “Kitty Moments” platform as a result of any illegal use or not permitted by us.</p>     </section>     <section id=\"links-to-external-websites\">       <h2>23. Links to External Websites</h2>       <p>23.1. The “Kitty Moments” platform may contain links to external websites of third parties; we do not control or endorse these websites and are not responsible for any content, ads, or other materials available on these websites.</p>       <p>23.2. Before enabling any sharing functions of the platform to communicate with or visit any of such websites, we recommend that you review and understand the privacy policy of each such third-party website you visit.</p>       <p>23.3. The use of any services owned or operated by third parties is subject to the terms and conditions of use and privacy policies of those third parties; you are solely responsible for all risks that